# The local widget module keeps its native source under modules/*/android, and
# that source is what has to be committed. The bare `android/` above exists to
# drop the prebuild output at apps/mobile/android, and would otherwise swallow
# the module's real code along with it. Re-include the directory, then ignore
# only the build output inside it.
!modules/
!modules/**/
modules/**/android/build/
modules/**/android/.gradle/
modules/**/android/local.properties

